<title>MALAYSIA: Kumpulan Guthrie 1996 net up 15.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Kumpulan Guthrie 1996 net up 15.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 151.54   vs	 131.26</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 15.2    vs	  13.1</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,612.38   vs     1,548.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   377.38   vs	 306.00</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 97.35   vs  less  76.81</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   12.23   vs	  20.26</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	12.0    vs	  10.0</p>
<p>    Special div (cents)	3.0    vs	   3.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Kumpulan Guthrie Bhd is mainly in plantations and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
